Increases your melee attack speed by 20%. In addition, attacks strike an additional nearby opponent. Lasts 20 sec.

@ext:Can't be active at the same time as Sweeping Strikes.
 
This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Strengthens you with the presence of blood, increasing damage by 2% and heals you for 1% of your damage dealt.

@ext:Only one Presence may be active at a time.:ext@

@ext:Heals up to a maximum of 5% of your health per hit.:ext@

While active, your spell critical strike chance is increased by 5%, but your healing done is reduced by 10%. Dealing direct spell damage now has a chance to reduce the target's healing received by 10%, stacking up to 3 times and lasting for 8 sec.

@ext:Cannot be used with bar-changing abilities like Stances or Forms.:ext@

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

